tdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxFhttps://www.culturalsurvival.org/news/my-dear-aki-please-dont-be-upsetƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Mi7mAGlA2E3SjbnRtwzvjUS0Wuahj7TDhbv0k_aPpgAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9https://newscable-source-broker.invalid/activitypub/actorƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eQKt2kuQdmHPzb9uMA-GOfTUNwCKrXcZvGlumeZmN2Mƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WE_kNr4TORt3tsaMMzP7i0Q9ZDveJ7Gbudr6MJahb_4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxFhttps://www.culturalsurvival.org/news/my-dear-aki-please-dont-be-upsetƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VZAI8qKV1vNWp-zpD8YhDVqLEQD-AxjI94uf5ZwFRUIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWed, 22 Jul 2026 17:50:23 +0000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;wo06kIkkLlJf5ZX1GTJlTZM9_mrLhzpQ-cLDpLVd3tcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;9x72DdVhi5Tf9bL0LDsgGBRO3184_FEATAjgSna6Zd4ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mVzgLqGcK8tEQkwp2FWq71ZQ4GQ03q_lCZlgPZ1qs2Qƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rxBZxnku3Kk04X5-lnwPgcbtXooJ2Q_3l3mHn3xfwVsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;LqMVXFRCZUtRzBSxlsHS4kpU-HvNaiIq6Si3mq-b_UIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;a-NvWBZnZRXGo3NOAHsCy4RL66smZW4TCx6Rphz9H6Iƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒ